{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom Shopify theme section for the Horizon theme called “Loyalty Program Steps”.
    
    Recreate the section based on the provided reference design.
    
    DESIGN:
    - Full-width dark luxury background.
    - Background should use a near-black / very dark charcoal color with a subtle warm brown-to-black gradient.
    - Add a thin vertical orange/red accent line along the far left edge of the section.
    - Overall aesthetic should feel premium, modern, slightly edgy, and suitable for a streetwear/outdoor lifestyle brand.
    - Use clean typography with uppercase headings.
    - Keep the layout spacious and centered.
    
    HEADER:
    - Small eyebrow text at the top:
      “LOYALTY PROGRAM”
    - Use small uppercase lettering with increased letter spacing.
    - Main heading:
      “GET REWARDED FOR”
      on the first line
      “LIVING OFF DUTY”
      on the second line.
    - Make the second line visually emphasized with a warm gradient from pink/red to orange.
    - Supporting text below:
      “Earn points when you shop, refer friends and support the Flip Flop Flight community.”
    - Center-align all header content.
    
    STEPS:
    Create 3 horizontally aligned cards on desktop and stack them vertically on mobile.
    
    CARD 1:
    - Number badge above the card: “01”
    - Badge should be circular with an orange/red gradient.
    - Icon: simple user/account icon.
    - Title: “CREATE AN ACCOUNT”
    - Description:
      “Sign up free and join the community instantly.”
    
    CARD 2:
    - Number badge: “02”
    - Badge should be circular with a pink/magenta gradient.
    - Icon: lightning/bolt icon.
    - Title: “EARN POINTS”
    - Description:
      “Every purchase, review and referral earns you points.”
    
    CARD 3:
    - Number badge: “03”
    - Badge should be circular with a gold/yellow gradient.
    - Icon: gift/reward icon.
    - Title: “REDEEM REWARDS”
    - Description:
      “Use points for discounts, exclusive gear and more.”
    
    CARD STYLING:
    - Cards should have a very dark background slightly lighter than the main section.
    - Thin subtle reddish/brown border.
    - Rounded corners around 12–14px.
    - Equal card heights.
    - Number badges should overlap the top edge of each card and be centered.
    - Icons should use the corresponding accent color.
    - Titles should be uppercase and compact.
    - Descriptions should be smaller, muted gray/white.
    - Add subtle hover animation:
      - card moves upward 3–4px
      - border becomes slightly brighter
      - transition should be smooth.
    - Do not use excessive shadows, gradients, or glassmorphism.
    
    BUTTONS:
    Place two centered buttons underneath the cards.
    
    Primary button:
    - Text: “Join Rewards”
    - Bright pink/red-to-orange gradient.
    - White text.
    - Rounded corners around 8px.
    - Medium height.
    
    Secondary button:
    - Text: “Member Login”
    - Transparent/dark background.
    - Thin cyan/teal border.
    - Cyan/teal text.
    - Same height as primary button.
    - Rounded corners around 8px.
    
    RESPONSIVE:
    - Desktop: 3 cards in one row.
    - Tablet: cards remain in a row if space allows, otherwise transition to 2/1 layout.
    - Mobile: cards stack vertically.
    - Buttons should remain side-by-side on larger screens and stack or become full-width on small mobile screens.
    - Maintain generous spacing and avoid horizontal overflow.
    
    SHOPIFY FUNCTIONALITY:
    - Build this as a reusable Shopify Horizon custom section.
    - All text should be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Allow merchants to edit:
      - eyebrow text
      - heading lines
      - description
      - each step title
      - each step description
      - button labels
      - button links
      - card icons
      - colors
      - background color
      - border color
      - spacing
      - border radius
    - Use Shopify section schema/settings so the section is fully configurable from the Theme Editor.
    - Use Shopify's native Liquid, HTML and CSS.
    - Do not require external apps or libraries.
    - Use inline SVG icons or CSS-based icons so the section works without external icon libraries.
    - Make sure the code is compatible with the Shopify Horizon theme and does not modify existing theme files.
    - Scope all CSS to this section so it does not affect other parts of the website.
    - Include accessible semantic HTML, keyboard-focus states, and responsive behavior.
    - Buttons should use Shopify links selected through the Theme Editor.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Match the provided reference image closely in layout, spacing, typography hierarchy, colors, card proportions, number badge positioning, and button placement. Do not add extra sections or unnecessary elements.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-loyalty-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, {{ block.settings.bg_color_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.bg_color_end }} 100%);
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.accent_line_width }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_line_color }};
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_font_size }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_margin_bottom }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__heading-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_line1_color }};
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__heading-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.heading_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.heading_gradient_end }} 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.cards_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.cards_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.card_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.card_padding_bottom }}px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-{{ block.settings.card_hover_lift }}px);
    border-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: -{{ block.settings.badge_size | divided_by: 2 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: {{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__badge--1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.badge1_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.badge1_gradient_end }} 100%);
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__badge--2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.badge2_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.badge2_gradient_end }} 100%);
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__badge--3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.badge3_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.badge3_gradient_end }} 100%);
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.icon_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_font_size }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.card_title_margin_bottom }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.buttons_gap }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.primary_button_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.primary_button_gradient_end }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.secondary_button_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-loyalty-steps__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_hover_bg }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-loyalty-steps__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-loyalty-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.cards_gap | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.5 }}px;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-loyalty-steps__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-loyalty-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <h2 class="ai-loyalty-steps__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank %}
          <span class="ai-loyalty-steps__heading-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}
          </span>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.heading_line2 != blank %}
          <span class="ai-loyalty-steps__heading-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading_line2 }}
          </span>
        {% endif %}
      </h2>

      {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
        <p class="ai-loyalty-steps__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.description }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-loyalty-steps__badge--1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step1_number }}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ block.settings.badge1_gradient_end }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step1_title }}
        </h3>
        <p class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step1_description }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-loyalty-steps__badge--2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step2_number }}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ block.settings.badge2_gradient_end }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step2_title }}
        </h3>
        <p class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step2_description }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-loyalty-steps__badge--3-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step3_number }}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ block.settings.badge3_gradient_end }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline>
            <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect>
            <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
            <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
            <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step3_title }}
        </h3>
        <p class="ai-loyalty-steps__card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.step3_description }}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-loyalty-steps__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.primary_button_text != blank %}
        <a 
          href="{{ block.settings.primary_button_link }}" 
          class="ai-loyalty-steps__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-loyalty-steps__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.primary_button_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.secondary_button_text != blank %}
        <a 
          href="{{ block.settings.secondary_button_link }}" 
          class="ai-loyalty-steps__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-loyalty-steps__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

